# Imports and Exports

- Do not create `index.ts` barrel files anywhere in the monorepo.
- Import directly from concrete files.

```ts
// ✅ GOOD
import { LevelQueries } from "../../queries/level/LevelQueries";
import type { LevelEntity } from "../../queries/level/LevelEntity";

// ❌ BAD
import { LevelQueries } from "../../queries/level";
```
